# Transcribed from Table I of the paper below (checked on the page image). Not a COD entry.
# C(6) y is printed with a damaged digit ("0.?05"); 0.105 is the only value that gives a normal
# C5-C6 bond (1.5 A) and it reproduces the paper's own Fcalc (see docs/polymer-library.md).
# O6S and O6D are the carboxyl oxygens (single- and double-bonded); OW is one water per residue.
# No hydrogen atoms or displacement parameters are given. Space group P212121 is the paper's
# stated "initial choice" for this fibre structure.
